## 🎯 Purpose

I am using this section to revise and consolidate fundamental computer science concepts and connect them to cybersecurity.

Understanding how hardware, memory, operating systems, processes, file systems, and permissions work provides an important foundation for studying areas such as system security, network security, malware analysis, vulnerability research, and cybersecurity engineering.
